<title>LATVIA: RIETUMU BANK'S ASSETS REACH 136.62 MLN LATS.</title>
<headline>RIETUMU BANK'S ASSETS REACH 136.62 MLN LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's Rietumu Bank said on Thursday that its assets rose in July by 12.7 million lats to 136.62 million lats.  </p>
<p>The bank added in a statement that its assets rose by 48.40 million lats or 54.48 percent in the first seven months of 1997.</p>
<p>It also said that its loan portfolio grew in the first seven months of the year by 185.84 percent to 21.41 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
</text>
